  "id": "reliability-coefficient",
  "term": "reliability coefficient",
  "definition": "A reliability coefficient is a numerical summary used to represent how reliable a scale is. In this context, it refers to a general reliability value estimated for a measure by bringing together reported Cronbach’s alpha results from multiple studies.",
